{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2021-08", "window": 1, "start_date": 1627776000, "end_date": 1628380799, "month_true_total": 50, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:19:39 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "97131854", "author": {"steamid": "76561198222958948", "personaname": "Mirpo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198222958948/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 141, "playtime_forever": 653, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 233, "last_played": 1644045720, "avatar": "9166b084f1e571101ee80131a67d09cb0a01e362"}, "language": "english", "review": "its fun but not as good as ror2", "timestamp_created": 1628371181, "timestamp_updated": 1631579736, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "97110598", "author": {"steamid": "76561198329483749", "personaname": "RabidInfant", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Rabid-Bastard/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 8692, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8677, "last_played": 1693270642, "avatar": "1788a124308073099a89970d45b9494bdf177d4c"}, "language": "english", "review": "good", "timestamp_created": 1628345137, "timestamp_updated": 1628345137, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "97083807", "author": {"steamid": "76561198211704213", "personaname": "dess", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/connorsuxattf2/", "num_games_owned": 153, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 614, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 614, "last_played": 1558196606, "avatar": "4ebf9ba3f019bc0820c129972785a89e1dbb127e"}, "language": "english", "review": "i miss this game", "timestamp_created": 1628307614, "timestamp_updated": 1628307614, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "97065647", "author": {"steamid": "76561198073417850", "personaname": "gabriel diniz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198073417850/", "num_games_owned": 137, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 6585, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6584, "last_played": 1641160664, "avatar": "97e463a36f2693f6158631fb69c4074694019c20"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is just amazing.\n\n-- Graphics 10/10 -- (f*ck off anyone who thinks pixelated graphics are outdated or bad)\nThe pixelart, for how small the player is, is just amazing - all the enemies and bosses are incredible, iconic, recognizable; all the items give visual indications that they are equipped; even when a billion things are happening on screen, you still know what's going on.\n\n-- Soundtrack 10/10 --\nI legit have some of the songs on my playlists on spotify, they are that good, even outside of the game. I also love how the title of the songs are usually rain-related\n\n-- Gameplay 11/10 --\nIt's. just. incredibly. FUN! Seeing all the crazy combos, synergies, stacking items, it's all just AMAZING. This is what roguelike should strive for when doing items, I think only The Binding Isaac is comparable to it. Playing alone feels amazing, it's so fluid, and you feel like a god when you're in a god run. For more intense gameplay and absurdity, I HIGHLY reccomend the artifacts, SPECIALLY the artifact of glass. FInding the artifacts on your own was also such a rewarding feat. Playing with friends is also so so good (no wonder the game pivoted more towards this in the second instalment)\n\n-- Lore ?/10 --\nNot gonna lie, I'm not the most knowledgeable with this one. I know it's mysterious, and I highly vibe with it. I've read the logs and everything, but it's all pretty vague, probably on purpose. Anyway, I bet it's fun theory-crafting or studying about the games' lore, if you're more into that\n\nthat's all folks, please give this game a chance :)\n\n", "timestamp_created": 1628279844, "timestamp_updated": 1628279844, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 11, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.598170578479766846", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "97062177", "author": {"steamid": "76561198163601149", "personaname": "Deadsocks", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198163601149/", "num_games_owned": 190, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 2661, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1217, "last_played": 1691265568, "avatar": "1711ea09f71881be1613a1d8145ac98996811efd"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very Ebic, Loader gang", "timestamp_created": 1628275536, "timestamp_updated": 1628275536, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}